diff --git a/COMMIT_MSG.txt b/COMMIT_MSG.txt
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..1b454cf
--- /dev/null
+++ b/COMMIT_MSG.txt
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+Add weekly subscription support
+
+- Add --every week flag to subtrack add command
+- Weekly plans charge every 7 days from their start date
+- Monthly cost calculated as: price × 52 ÷ 12, rounded to nearest cent
+- Support both 'week' and 'weekly' as cycle aliases
+- Fix renewals sorting to use chronological order (by date, not by label)
+- All existing monthly/yearly tests pass
+- Add comprehensive tests for weekly cycle behavior
+
+Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
